<title>USA: Cellular Communications Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Cellular Communications Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>								 Sept. 30</p>
<p>							    1996	 1995</p>
<p>				    (in thousands, except subscribers</p>
<p>							and per share data)</p>
<p> Revenues					     30,364     22,738</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				   2,273    (1,570)</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per common share		.16	(.13)</p>
